        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of elevated tryptophan metabolites plus either enzyme deficiency confirmation or pathogenic genetic variant identification",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies heavily on biochemical assays and genetic testing; clinical presentation may vary."
